    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;Stone doesn&rsquo;t hurry. You don&rsquo;t either.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>Stone Patience.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as a bonus action: root yourself. Until the start of your next turn, you cannot be moved by any effect (forced or voluntary), and you cannot gain the <strong>shaken</strong> or <strong>scarred</strong> conditions. You also cannot take any movement action. If taken to 0 Integrity during this, you remain upright &mdash; the collapse happens next round.</p>",
